    "https://careers.cccu.org/job/instructor-assistant-professor-of-psychology-charleston-south-carolina-12595": {
      "title": "Instructor/Assistant Professor of Psychology",
      "description": "Instructor/Assistant Professor of Psychology in Charleston, South Carolina | Council for Christian Colleges and Universities Home Search Directory Contact Us Career Resources Career Advice Interview Coach Offer Analyzer Pricing Register Job Seekers Employers Sign In Post a Job Instructor/Assistant Professor of Psychology Charleston Southern University Charleston, South Carolina Share Save Job Apply for This Job Position Overview The Department of Psychology at Charleston Southern University invites applications for an Instructor or Assistant Professor of Psychology . Charleston Southern University seeks candidates for faculty positions who are professing Christians and who are committed to excellence in teaching and service. They should support the goals of a strong liberal arts education and be willing to explore with students the integration of faith and learning. Key Responsibilities The successful candidate will have the ability to teach the following courses: General Psychology, and relevant combinations of: Introduction to Statistics, Physiological Psychology, Cognitive Psychology, Physiological Psychology and/or Forensic Psychology, and others as developed. The course load is 12 hours per major semester of undergraduate courses.  Involvement within the department, student advising, campus service and professional development are required. Teaching in the summer is available for additional pay; courses are taught both in person and online. Qualifications Qualifications Earned Ph.D. in Psychology is preferred but A.B.D. status or an M.S. from an accredited institution will be considered. The successful applicant will provide evidence of excellence in teaching and scholarly activity. Job Information Job Category: Faculty Careers - Psychology Education: Master's Degree Related Jobs Full time Faculty, Counseling Psychology - College of Education and Behavioral Sciences Azusa Pacific University Azusa, California Posted - August 27, 2026 View Assistant/Associate Professor of History LeTourneau University Longview, Texas Posted - September 3, 2026 View Full-time Faculty, Marriage and Family Therapy - College of Education and Behavioral Sciences Azusa Pacific University Azusa, California Posted - August 27, 2026 View Assistant, Associate, or Full Professor of Language and Literacy Education Gordon College Wenham, Massachusetts Posted - September 2, 2026 View Director, The Center for Academic MInistry LeTourneau University Longview, Texas Posted - August 21, 2026 View Faculty, Clinical Psychology - College of Education and Behavioral Sciences Azusa Pacific University Azusa, California Posted - August 27, 2026 View Show More Jobs Trending Job Titles Associate Professor of Finance Nursing Assistant Professor Trending Locations Iowa Birmingham, Alabama Longview, Texas Texas Ohio ORANGE CITY, Iowa Florida Houston, Texas Cedarville, Ohio Portland, Oregon Minnesota West Palm Beach, Florida Virginia Alabama California Oregon Azusa, California Virginia Beach, Virginia St. Paul, Minnesota Trending Companies Cedarville University Azusa Pacific University Palm Beach Atlantic University Houston Christian University Regent University Northwestern College Samford University LeTourneau University Trending Categories Faculty Careers - Psychology Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Religion Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Other Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Education Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Apply for this job Find Jobs By Category Education Faculty Careers - Health Professions Faculty Careers - Biology/Life Sciences Faculty Careers - Psychology Higher Ed Administrative Careers - Development/Fundraising Faculty Careers - Engineering Faculty Careers - Communication/Design/Media Faculty Careers - Religion Powered by Web Scribble Solutions , Inc. About Our Work & Mission Our Institutions Leadership Contact Us Join Us Advertise Donate Employment Membership Sponsorship Follow Us Council for Christian Colleges & Universities 20 M Street SE, Suite 350 , Washington, D.C. 20003 202.546.8713"
